{
  "id": "illustrated-story",
  "abi": "8",
  "name": "插画剪报",
  "keywords": [
    "插画",
    "剪报",
    "拼贴",
    "小故事",
    "散文",
    "夏天"
  ],
  "when": "一段小故事或观察随笔，交给满幅米色拼贴纸与逐字剪贴字幕时",
  "blocks": [
    "scene.code"
  ],
  "style": {
    "fonts": {
      "display": "sans-400",
      "body": "sans-400",
      "num": "latin-700",
      "caption": "sans-900",
      "hand": "ZTZiYouTi",
      "serif": "WenYuanSerifSC-Bold"
    },
    "colors": {
      "bg": "#FAF7F0",
      "ink": "#33312C",
      "muted": "#8B8578",
      "accent": "#E2574C",
      "line": "#D8D2C4"
    },
    "backgrounds": {
      "paper": "#FAF7F0"
    }
  },
  "rules": {
    "safeMargin": 0.06,
    "scale": {
      "title": 1,
      "label": 0.8,
      "note": 0.6
    },
    "stroke": [
      2,
      4
    ],
    "board": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "value": "cream"
    },
    "forbid": [
      "把故事题材写成枚举参数或用模板选讲哪一则；内容必须实时写在 scene.code 里",
      "在同一幅拼贴上叠两种字幕样式；剪贴字只能有一层",
      "在 code 里再铺一层底色；米色纸只来自 TT.board.cream",
      "用整块平涂色域代替纸片；纸片边缘必须是手绘撕边或排线",
      "字幕压住主体；主体集中在画面上半，字幕带留在下半"
    ]
  },
  "captions": {
    "style": "collage",
    "font": "display",
    "baseSize": 44,
    "lineHeight": 1.34,
    "top": 0.8,
    "at": "bottom",
    "size": 1.1,
    "maxWidth": 0.62
  },
  "audio": {
    "mood": "soft",
    "volume": 0.1,
    "fadeIn": 1.6,
    "fadeOut": 2.4,
    "duck": {
      "level": 0.04,
      "edge": 0.22
    }
  },
  "verify": [
    {
      "at": 0.15,
      "assert": "ink.insideSafe",
      "args": {
        "margin": 0.06
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "element.count.gte",
      "args": {
        "n": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "caption.noOverlapSubject",
      "args": {}
    }
  ]
}
